{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_309","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'CRPS|volatility|score' .venv/lib/python*/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py .venv/lib/python*/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py | head -n 100\"","aggregated_output":".venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:19:    Calculate the total CRPS score for a miner's simulations over specified intervals,\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:20:    Return the sum of the scores.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:29:        float: Sum of total CRPS scores over the intervals.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:31:    # Initialize lists to store detailed CRPS data\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:33:    sum_all_scores = 0.0\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:75:        # Calculate CRPS over intervals\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:84:        # Total CRPS for this interval\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:86:        sum_all_scores += total_crps_interval\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:97:                \"CRPS\": total_crps_interval,\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:103:            {\"Interval\": \"Gaps\", \"Increment\": \"Total\", \"CRPS\": gap_total_crps}\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:107:        {\"Interval\": \"Overall\", \"Increment\": \"Total\", \"CRPS\": sum_all_scores}\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:110:    return sum_all_scores, detailed_crps_data\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:120:    Calculate the weighted volatility CRPS for a miner's simulations.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:123:    realized volatility of every block is scored against the ensemble of\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:124:    simulated block volatilities, and the per-block CRPS values are summed\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:135:        float: Sum of the weighted volatility CRPS over the block sizes.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:138:    sum_all_scores = 0.0\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:159:        sum_all_scores += weight * crps_sum\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:165:                \"CRPS\": crps_sum,\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:171:        {\"Interval\": \"Vol\", \"Increment\": \"Total\", \"CRPS\": sum_all_scores}\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:174:    return sum_all_scores, detailed_crps_data\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:177:def calculate_total_score_for_miner(\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:185:    Calculate a miner's total score: the price CRPS plus the weighted\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:186:    volatility CRPS. A competition with no volatility blocks scores on the\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:187:    price CRPS alone.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:190:        float: The total score.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:192:    price_score, detailed_crps_data = calculate_crps_for_miner(\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:197:    # zero-price guard the volatility blocks depend on: never add to it.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:198:    if not vol_scoring_blocks or price_score == -1.0:\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:199:        return price_score, detailed_crps_data\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:201:    vol_score, detailed_vol_data = calculate_vol_crps_for_miner(\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:204:    total_score = price_score + vol_score\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:206:    # \"Overall\" holds the score actually returned and stays the last row.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:212:        {\"Interval\": \"Overall\", \"Increment\": \"Total\", \"CRPS\": total_score}\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:215:    return total_score, detailed_data\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:226:    Sum the CRPS over the observed (non-missing) blocks of a single interval.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:239:        # Calculate all CRPS values at once\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/crps_calculation.py:309:    Calculate the volatility of each consecutive block of a price path.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:5:# 1h score = price CRPS + VOL_CRPS_LAMBDA × the mean, over the block sizes,\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:6:# of the mean per-block volatility CRPS — so each weight below must stay\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:7:# VOL_CRPS_LAMBDA / (3 block sizes × the number of blocks of that size).\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:8:VOL_CRPS_LAMBDA = 5.25\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:18:    # Volatility CRPS blocks: name -> (block duration in seconds, weight).\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:19:    # Empty means the competition scores on the price CRPS alone.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:104:        \"vol_60min\": (3600, VOL_CRPS_LAMBDA / 3),  # 1 block\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:105:        \"vol_15min\": (900, VOL_CRPS_LAMBDA / 12),  # 4 blocks\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:106:        \"vol_5min\": (300, VOL_CRPS_LAMBDA / 36),  # 12 blocks\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:123:# and blended in via the external-ingestion path (vhft_score_provider +\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:124:# compute_vhft_smoothed_score), NOT through the inline-CRPS path — so it is\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:136:    # window_days is nominal — the external scorer already windows the scores, so\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:143:    # Beta responds to the SPREAD between miners, not the absolute score level:\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:144:    # the scorer subtracts each prompt's winner and softmax is invariant to that\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:145:    # shared offset, so shifting every score changes nothing. A wider field\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:147:    # changing this; do not reason from the score level.\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:149:    # MUST stay negative (lower score = higher reward), same convention as the\n.venv/lib/python3.12/site-packages/synth/validator/competition_config.py:155:# compute_vhft_smoothed_score — outside this range the blend is skipped for the\n.venv/